| Tool | File | Description | Input | Output |
|------|------|-------------|-------|--------|
| Analysis Engine | tools/writing/analysis_engine.py | Unified deterministic quality analysis (grammar, readability, tone, plagiarism, AI detection) | (library) — `analyze(text)` | Quality scores per dimension |
| Grammar Checker | tools/writing/grammar_checker.py | Thin wrapper re-exporting grammar check from analysis_engine | (library) — `check_grammar(text)` | Grammar issues list |
| Readability Scorer | tools/writing/readability_scorer.py | Thin wrapper re-exporting readability scoring from analysis_engine | (library) — `score_readability(text)` | Readability metrics (Flesch, grade level) |
| Tone Profiler | tools/writing/tone_profiler.py | Thin wrapper re-exporting tone profiling from analysis_engine (scanner-tier LLM) | (library) — `profile_tone(text)` | Tone classification + confidence |
| Plagiarism Detector | tools/writing/plagiarism_detector.py | Thin wrapper re-exporting plagiarism check from analysis_engine (RAG similarity, 0.85 threshold) | (library) — `check_plagiarism(text)` | Similarity scores |
| AI Content Detector | tools/writing/ai_content_detector.py | Deterministic AI detection — perplexity, burstiness, n-gram stats (D-WG-6, advisory-only) | (library) — `detect_ai_content(text)` | AI probability + signals |
| Portion Marking Checker | tools/writing/portion_marking_checker.py | DoDM 5200.01 portion marking validator: all-or-nothing rule, high-water mark banner derivation, designation indicator block, contradiction detection | --file, --text, --json, --gate | Violations list, derived banner, designation block, compliance score 0-100 |
| LLM Judge | tools/writing/llm_judge.py | Rubric-based semantic evaluation using Prometheus-2 7B (local Ollama) — 5 dimensions per content type | --text, --rubric, --json | Color ratings + scores |
| Ubiquitous Language | tools/writing/ubiquitous_language.py | DDD glossary extractor — noun-phrase extraction, synonym + ambiguity detection, optional LLM enrichment via LLMRouter. Adapted from mattpocock/skills/ubiquitous-language (MIT) | --input FILE, --out FILE, --llm-enrich, --append-to-memory, --json, --gate | UBIQUITOUS_LANGUAGE.md + JSON summary |
| Style Profiler | tools/writing/style_profiler.py | Deterministic 28-feature writer fingerprint: sentence stats (5), vocabulary (4), paragraph (4), structure (3), voice (4), tone (3), connective (2), punctuation (3). Min 1500 words. Zero LLM. | (library) — `extract_profile(text, name) -> StyleProfile`; CLI: --file, --name, --json, --gate | StyleProfile dataclass with feature_vector() + compare() |
| Word Limit | tools/writing/word_limit.py | Per-section word cap checker for WriteGuard. Parses YAML config, splits markdown by heading, checks counts against limits with warn (80%) / over (100%) thresholds. Zero LLM. | (library) — `parse_limits(yaml_str)`, `count_by_section(text)`, `check_limits(text, limits)`; CLI: --json | {sections, violations, total_words, passed} |
| Style Matcher | tools/writing/style_matcher.py | Score text against a saved StyleProfile, generate deterministic rewrite instructions to close the style gap (WG 10c). Weighted feature distance + noticeable-difference thresholds. Zero LLM. | (library) — `score_against_profile(text, profile)`, `generate_style_instructions(text, profile)`; CLI: --text, --file, --profile, --json | {style_match_score 0-100, per_feature_deltas, instructions} |
| Classification Detector | tools/writing/classification_detector.py | DoD/IC classification indicator scanner per DoDM 5200.01 + EO 13526 + CUI Registry. 23 regex patterns across PII, PROCURE, ITAR, SP-CTI, INTEL, OPS, COORDS. Confidence levels HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW (WG 11a). Aid only — requires OCA review. | (library) — `scan_indicators(text)`, `classify_paragraph(para)`; CLI: --text, --file, --json | indicators + suggested_classification + banner + disclaimer |
| Auto-Portion-Marker | tools/writing/auto_marker.py | Auto-applies DoD portion marks per paragraph + derives high-water-mark banner (DoDM 5200.01 Vol 2). Aggregates dissemination controls, flags compilation risk for 3+ CUI//SP-CTI paragraphs (WG 11b). | (library) — `auto_mark_document(text)`, `format_marked_document(result)`; CLI: --text, --file, --json, --format | {paragraphs, banner, designation_block, compilation_warning, human_review_required} |
| Rewriter | tools/writing/rewriter.py | Deterministic regex-based writing fixes (13 informal + 5 hedging replacements) + transition word analysis for pacing. No LLM (WG 7a). | (library) — `apply_deterministic_fixes(text)`, `analyze_transitions(text)`; CLI: --text, --file, --json | {rewritten_text, changes_made, change_count, pacing_score} |
| Glossary Engine | tools/writing/glossary_engine.py | Custom acronym + corporate terms + forbidden word validator (WG 4c). Loads from context/writeguard/glossary.yaml. | (library) — `check_glossary(text, glossary_path=None)` | {score, undefined_acronyms, forbidden_hits, suggestions} |
| Style Guide Cascade | tools/writing/style_guide.py | Cascaded style guide resolver (project→org→global) + content-type rubric enforcement + CUI compliance vocabulary (WG 5a/5b). | (library) — `check_style_guide(text, project_id, content_type)` | {score, guide_loaded, rules_applied, content_type, issues} |
| Content Modes | tools/writing/content_modes.py | Per-mode rule overrides (blameless_postmortem, policy_language, adr, bluf_exec, runbook, rca) — adjusts WriteGuard weights + extra checks per content type (WG 12). | (library) — `apply_mode_overrides(text, mode)`, `available_modes()` | mode-specific scores + findings |
| Audience Scorer | tools/writing/audience_scorer.py | Score readability/jargon/tone for CEO, CFO, Board, Engineer, Auditor, Lawyer personas (WG 13). | (library) — `score_for_audience(text, persona)`, `available_personas()`; CLI | {match_score, issues, suggestions, metrics} |
| Structure Enforcer | tools/writing/structure_enforcer.py | Enforce required sections for RCA, ADR, pitch, policy, runbook, pilot_proposal templates (WG 14). Config in args/writeguard_structures.yaml. | (library) — `detect_structure_type(text)`, `enforce_structure(text, template)` | missing_sections, score |
| Claim Validator | tools/writing/claim_validator.py | Flag unsupported claims — numbers, superlatives, comparisons, universal quantifiers, trend claims without citations (WG 15). | (library) — `find_claims(text)`, `score_evidence_density(text)` | {evidence_score, supported, unsupported, by_type} |
| Numeric Validator | tools/writing/numeric_validator.py | CIDR/IP consistency, VLAN range, ASN public/private, percent sums, year totals, currency, date/time format checks (WG 16). Uses stdlib `ipaddress`. | (library) — `validate_numerics(text)`; CLI | {issues, score, summary} |
| Bias Detector | tools/writing/bias_detector.py | Detect gender/age/ability-coded language, context-aware for perf_review/job_description (WG 17). | (library) — `detect_bias(text, context)`; CLI --context | {issues, score, by_category} |
| Runbook Linter | tools/writing/runbook_linter.py | Enforce runbook best practices — numbered steps, imperative verbs, verification/rollback, prereqs, time estimates (WG 19). | (library) — `lint_runbook(text)`; CLI | {step_count, with_verification, with_rollback, issues} |
| Diff Scorer | tools/writing/diff_scorer.py | Compare two WriteGuard analyses — per-dimension deltas, improvements, regressions (WG 20). | (library) — `diff_analyses(old_text, new_text)`, `diff_by_id(old_id, new_id)` | {word_diff, score_diff, dimension_deltas, net_change} |
| Review Linter | tools/writing/review_linter.py | ARB/ERB review comment linter — requires section ref + decision verb + recommendation per comment (WG 21). | (library) — `lint_review_comments(text)`; CLI | {score, comment_count, with_section_ref, with_verb, with_recommendation} |
| Standards Validator | tools/writing/standards_validator.py | Validate NIST SP 800-53/171, TOGAF, OWASP, CIS, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, SABSA citations against args/standards_registry.yaml (WG 22). | (library) — `validate_citations(text)`; CLI | {citations, valid, wrong_title, not_found, missing_section, score} |
| Precedent Checker | tools/writing/precedent_checker.py | Search prior ARB/ERB decisions in wg_board_decisions table; detect contradictions via keyword overlap (WG 23). | (library) — `record_decision()`, `check_precedents()`, `list_decisions()`; CLI --check/--record/--list | {matches, score, contradicts_current} |
| Alternatives Enforcer | tools/writing/alternatives_enforcer.py | Detect ADR/design docs + require named alternatives with trade-off analysis (WG 24). | (library) — `enforce_alternatives(text)`; CLI | {is_decision_doc, has_alternatives, alternative_count, trade_off_quality_score} |
| STRIDE Checker | tools/writing/stride_checker.py | Threat model coverage — 6 STRIDE categories with completeness checks (threat/mitigation/residual) (WG 25). | (library) — `stride_coverage(text)`; CLI | {present, missing, per_category_completeness, overall_coverage_score} |
| Reproducibility Validator | tools/writing/reproducibility_validator.py | Validate commands/versions pinned, perf claims with methodology, crypto specificity, environment specified (WG 26). | (library) — `validate_reproducibility(text)`; CLI | {issues, severity, suggestions, reproducibility_score} |
| Neutrality Scorer | tools/writing/neutrality_scorer.py | ARB pre-read/dissent tone — flag pre-decided language + personal attacks; reward professional dissent markers (WG 27). | (library) — `score_neutrality(text)`; CLI | {score, pre_decided_flags, attack_flags, dissent_quality} |
| Parallel Generator | tools/writing/parallel_generator.py | Generate side-by-side technical + 5-line executive BLUF from the same source — deterministic key fact extraction (WG 28). | (library) — `extract_key_facts()`, `generate_executive_summary()`, `generate_parallel()`; CLI --exec-only | {technical_version, executive_version, key_numbers_preserved} |

